# 供 services/indextts/Dockerfile 使用（BuildKit 会优先读 <Dockerfile>.dockerignore，
# 因此本文件不会影响仓库根 Dockerfile 构建 app 镜像的语义）。
#
# 构建上下文是仓库根，而 IndexTTS 引擎目录约 22GB（.venv 8.2G + checkpoints 14G）。
# 不排除的话每次 docker compose build 都要把它们 tar 进上下文，在开发机上无法忍受。
# 镜像只需要引擎的**源码**（indextts/，28M）与依赖清单，权重由 compose 只读挂载。

# ---- 引擎：权重与虚拟环境不进上下文 ----
services/indextts/engine/.venv
services/indextts/engine/venv
services/indextts/engine/checkpoints
services/indextts/engine/.git
services/indextts/engine/.github

# ---- 引擎：与本服务无关的上游资料 ----
services/indextts/engine/archive
services/indextts/engine/assets
services/indextts/engine/docs
services/indextts/engine/examples
services/indextts/engine/tests
services/indextts/engine/tools
services/indextts/engine/webui.py
services/indextts/engine/._____temp

# ---- 桥接层运行期产物 ----
services/indextts/__pycache__
services/indextts/logs
services/indextts/.env

# ---- 仓库其余部分：本镜像一概不用 ----
node_modules
dist
logs
uploads
.runtime
.git
.claude
.vscode
__tests__
docs
wx
mcp
public
type
